<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 31/AUGUST 1.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 31/AUGUST 1.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Thursday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for July 31/August 1. The kroon is</p>
<p>pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	     July 30/August 1   July 30/31</p>
<p>    CZK    0.42621	     0.42511</p>
<p>    DKK    2.09992	     2.10082</p>
<p>    FIM    2.69136	     2.69191</p>
<p>    GBP   24.03414	    23.96475</p>
<p>    HUF    0.07477	     0.07488</p>
<p>    LTL    3.66519	     3.67516</p>
<p>    LVL   25.08948	    25.16594</p>
<p>    RUR    0.00252	     0.00253</p>
<p>    SEK    1.84688	     1.84303</p>
<p>    UAH    7.89959	     7.919</p>
<p>    USD   14.6648	     14.7032</p>
<p>    XEU   15.77419	    15.77653</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
